## Introduction to P2P Trading on Quidax

P2P allows users to trade crypto directly with others using NGN payments.
Quidax acts as an escrow to protect both traders.

How to Use Quidax P2P (Buying or Selling)

The exact same steps apply to both buying and selling.

1️⃣ Select an Offer
<p align="center"> <img src="1764489583214.jpg" width="300"><br> <img src="1764489565920.jpg" width="300"><br> <img src="1764489541672.jpg" width="300"> </p>
2️⃣ Quidax Locks the Crypto Assets
<p align="center"><img src="1764489513178.jpg" width="300"></p>

Prevents fraud and guarantees safe trading.

3️⃣ Buyer Makes Payment
<p align="center"><img src="1764489450895.jpg" width="300"></p>

Payment is usually via bank transfer.

4️⃣ Seller Confirms Payment & Releases Crypto
<p align="center"><img src="1764489380180.jpg" width="300"></p>

Once released, funds move to the buyer instantly.

5️⃣ Transaction Completed

Crypto moves to the buyer’s P2P wallet.

**Important P2P Safety Tips**

Avoid sellers offering unusually high or low rates

Never release crypto before confirming payment

Verify account names before transferring NGN

